<!-- Cloud Socks · "¿Son para vos?" · Para pegar en un bloque "Liquid personalizado" -->
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Poppins:wght@400;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

<style>
  #cs-benef-cs1 {
    box-sizing: border-box; width: 100%;
    background: transparent;
    color: #1B2A4A;
    padding: 40px 16px;
    text-align: center;
    font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif;
  }
  #cs-benef-cs1 .cs-wrap { max-width: 1120px; margin: 0 auto; }
  #cs-benef-cs1 .cs-titulo {
    font-family: inherit; font-weight: 700; color: inherit; margin: 0;
    font-size: clamp(30px, 8vw, 56px); line-height: 1.1; letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  }
  #cs-benef-cs1 .cs-sub {
    font-size: clamp(16px, 4vw, 24px); line-height: 1.4; margin: 10px 0 0; opacity: .85;
  }
  #cs-benef-cs1 .cs-grid {
    display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 8px; margin: 24px 0 0; padding: 0; list-style: none;
  }
  #cs-benef-cs1 .cs-card {
    background: #1B2A4A;
    color: #F5F1E8;
    border-radius: 20px;
    display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
    gap: 10px; padding: 16px 6px; min-height: 132px; margin: 0;
  }
  #cs-benef-cs1 .cs-icono { width: 36px; height: 36px; flex-shrink: 0; }
  #cs-benef-cs1 .cs-icono svg {
    width: 100%; height: 100%; display: block;
    fill: none; stroke: currentColor; stroke-width: 2.4; stroke-linecap: round; stroke-linejoin: round;
  }
  #cs-benef-cs1 .cs-icono img { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: contain; display: block; }
  #cs-benef-cs1 .cs-card p {
    margin: 0; color: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.25; text-wrap: balance; overflow-wrap: anywhere; hyphens: auto;
  }
  #cs-benef-cs1 .cs-pie { font-size: 14px; margin: 24px 0 0; opacity: .85; }
  #cs-benef-cs1 .cs-pie p { margin: 0; }
  #cs-benef-cs1 .cs-pie a { color: inherit; text-decoration: underline; }

  @media screen and (max-width: 340px) {
    #cs-benef-cs1 .cs-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); }
  }

  @media screen and (min-width: 750px) {
    #cs-benef-cs1 { padding: 64px 24px; }
    #cs-benef-cs1 .cs-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 24px; margin-top: 44px;
    }
    #cs-benef-cs1 .cs-card { min-height: 200px; padding: 28px 24px; gap: 16px; }
    #cs-benef-cs1 .cs-icono { width: 60px; height: 60px; }
    #cs-benef-cs1 .cs-card p { font-size: 20px; }
    #cs-benef-cs1 .cs-pie { font-size: 18px; margin-top: 36px; }
  }
</style>

<div id="cs-benef-cs1" class="cs-beneficios">
  <div class="cs-wrap">
    <h2 class="cs-titulo">¿Son para vos?</h2>
    <p class="cs-sub">Cloud Socks son ideales si querés:</p>

    <ul class="cs-grid" role="list">
      <li class="cs-card">
        <div class="cs-icono"><svg viewBox="0 0 64 64" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M8 8h48M8 8l4-3.5M8 8l4 3.5M56 8l-4-3.5M56 8l-4 3.5"/><path d="M26 60c-6 0-8.5-7-8-14.5.4-7 2.5-10.5 2.5-15 0-3.5 2.5-5.5 6-5.5h11c4.5 0 7 2.5 7 7 0 5 2 9.5 2 16.5 0 7.5-4 11.5-10 11.5z"/><circle cx="41" cy="19" r="4.6"/><circle cx="31" cy="17.5" r="3.3"/><circle cx="23.5" cy="19.5" r="2.9"/><circle cx="17" cy="23.5" r="2.5"/><circle cx="12" cy="29" r="2.1"/></svg></div>
        <p>Que tus dedos no se aprieten más</p>
      </li>
      <li class="cs-card">
        <div class="cs-icono"><svg viewBox="0 0 64 64" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><g transform="rotate(45 32 32)"><rect x="11" y="25" width="42" height="14" rx="7"/><path d="M25 25v14M39 25v14"/><circle cx="30" cy="30" r=".6" fill="currentColor"/><circle cx="34" cy="34" r=".6" fill="currentColor"/><circle cx="34" cy="30" r=".6" fill="currentColor"/><circle cx="30" cy="34" r=".6" fill="currentColor"/></g><circle cx="32" cy="32" r="27"/><path d="M13 51L51 13"/></svg></div>
        <p>Chau ampollas y dolor de pies</p>
      </li>
      <li class="cs-card">
        <div class="cs-icono"><svg viewBox="0 0 64 64" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M24 10s-13 16-13 26a13 13 0 0 0 26 0c0-10-13-26-13-26z"/><path d="M18 37a6 6 0 0 0 6 6"/><path d="M42 22h11a4 4 0 1 0-4-4M42 32h16M42 42h11a4 4 0 1 1-4 4"/></svg></div>
        <p>Pies secos y frescos todo el día</p>
      </li>
      <li class="cs-card">
        <div class="cs-icono"><svg viewBox="0 0 64 64" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M23 47c-4-4 4-8 0-12s4-8 0-12"/><path d="M32 47c-4-4 4-8 0-12s4-8 0-12"/><path d="M41 47c-4-4 4-8 0-12s4-8 0-12"/><circle cx="32" cy="32" r="27"/><path d="M13 13l38 38"/></svg></div>
        <p>Olvidarte del mal olor</p>
      </li>
      <li class="cs-card">
        <div class="cs-icono"><svg viewBox="0 0 64 64" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M19 47h27a10 10 0 0 0 1-20 14 14 0 0 0-27-3 11.5 11.5 0 0 0-1 23z"/></svg></div>
        <p>Sentir tus pies en una nube</p>
      </li>
      <li class="cs-card">
        <div class="cs-icono"><svg viewBox="0 0 64 64" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M32 7l18 7v15c0 13-8 22-18 27-10-5-18-14-18-27V14z"/><path d="M24 31l6 6 11-12"/></svg></div>
        <p>Talón y punta reforzados, para que duren</p>
      </li>
    </ul>

    <div class="cs-pie"><p>¿Tenés dudas? Escribinos y te ayudamos.</p></div>
  </div>
</div>
